{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1202","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. You Are Given Some Strings..."}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$t$$$ and $$$n$$$ strings $$$s_1, s_2, \\dots, s_n$$$. All strings consist of lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$f(t, s)$$$ be the number of occurences of string $$$s$$$ in string $$$t$$$. For example, $$$f('\\text{aaabacaa}', '\\text{aa}') = 3$$$, and $$$f('\\text{ababa}', '\\text{aba}') = 2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Calculate the value of $$$\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n} \\sum\\limits_{j=1}^{n} f(t, s_i + s_j)$$$, where $$$s + t$$$ is the concatenation of strings $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$. Note that if there are two pairs $$$i_1$$$, $$$j_1$$$ and $$$i_2$$$, $$$j_2$$$ such that $$$s_{i_1} + s_{j_1} = s_{i_2} + s_{j_2}$$$, you should include both $$$f(t, s_{i_1} + s_{j_1})$$$ and $$$f(t, s_{i_2} + s_{j_2})$$$ in answer."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains string $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le |t| \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of next $$$n$$$ lines contains string $$$s_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le |s_i| \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that $$$\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n} |s_i| \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$. All strings consist of lowercase English letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the value of $$$\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n} \\sum\\limits_{j=1}^{n} f(t, s_i + s_j)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\naaabacaa\n2\na\naa\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\naaabacaa\n4\na\na\na\nb\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n33\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1202E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1202/problem/E"}